<title>ALGERIA: SOCCER-AFRICAN CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AFRICAN CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ALGIERS 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in African Champions' Cup</p>
<p>first leg semifinal matches on Friday:</p>
<p>Jeunesse Kabylie (Algeria) 1 Shooting Stars (Nigeria) 1</p>
<p>Chabab Belouizdad (Algeria) 1 Sodigraf (Zaire) 1</p>
<p>CAF Cup semifinal, first leg:</p>
<p>In Sousse: Etoile Sahel (Tunisia) 2 Vita Club (Zaire) 0</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Riyadh Jelassi (9th), Imed Ben Younes (67th)</p>
